  "name": "unikit",
  "description": "Initialize the UniKit framework in a project. Scans the current project to detect the engine and real tech stack, then generates the base framework documents that give AI agents context about the project — the resolved project description, the architecture doc, AGENTS.md, and the user-editable .unikit/config.yaml. This is the one-time, whole-project setup run before any other unikit skill. Use whenever the user wants to initialize, set up, or onboard the framework, e.g. \"initialize unikit\", \"init the framework\", \"set up unikit\", \"set up the project\", \"configure AI context\", \"scan my project and set it up\", \"bootstrap the project\". It also actualizes the config of a project already set up — say \"update the config\", \"add missing settings\", \"actualize configuration\", \"fix my config\". On a set-up project it offers the actions to choose from.",
